So far we have shown that  $\mathfrak{S}_{xyz}
abla_x\kappa(y,z)|_p = 0$ at
all points $p$ of $M$ where $\mathrm{d} \, \mathrm{tr} \, \kappa|_p 
eq 0$ or $\mathrm{tr} \, \kappa$ is constant on an open neighbourhood of $p$. Obviously the set of these points is dense in $M$. Since moreover the set points where the cyclic sum $\mathfrak{S}_{xyz}
abla_x\kappa(y,z)$ vanishes is closed, we conclude that $\kappa$ is Killing.

